                    {
                        "sense_id": "51f243a0-18d8-3339-aa1b-1db2d1448fbd",
                        "entry_id": "c833ffb0-93f3-330b-a241-0141a3370353",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A discordant high-pitched noise."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "76db27bf-8018-4d55-93cd-049e806c3dc3",
                                "sense_id": "51f243a0-18d8-3339-aa1b-1db2d1448fbd",
                                "text": "The screams began as the usual long screel."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4dfe245d-6178-47b7-975a-dda3b245b5ec",
                                "sense_id": "51f243a0-18d8-3339-aa1b-1db2d1448fbd",
                                "text": "Someone had got hold of a bullhorn and was bellowing out instructions that, thanks to screels of feedback, were utterly incomprehensible."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9bfa80d4-e9d4-4670-8048-1f0865f2fa96",
                                "sense_id": "51f243a0-18d8-3339-aa1b-1db2d1448fbd",
                                "text": "As for the Minimoog itself, it proved capable of creating whole new registers of possibility: a viscid bass that stirs the entrails, a tonal warmth that solicits well-being, a cringing static that conjures animal fear, a piercing screel that commands almost spiritual submission."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
